{"ref":"BDB, נָכֵה","hw":"נָכֵה","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">נָכֵה</span>]</big>  <strong>adj. smitten, stricken</strong> (cf. [<a data-ref=\"BDB, נָכָא²\" href=\"/BDB,_נָכָא²\", dir=\"rtl\">נָכָא</a>]);—only cstr.: <span dir=\"rtl\">נְכֵה רַגְלַיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 4:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.4.4\">2 S 4:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 9:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.9.3\">9:3</a> <em>crippled of feet;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">נְכֵה־רוּחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 66:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.66.2\">Is 66:2</a> <em>contrite of spirit</em> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">עָנִי</span>).","next":"BDB, נֵכֶה","prev":"BDB, נָכָה"}